This package contains the MediaTek MT7668 SDIO drivers from
https://github.com/CoreELEC/MT7668 with local compatibility changes.

WiFi sources: Copyright MediaTek Inc., 2003-2017 and contributors.
Individual source headers offer GPL version 2 or the BSD 3-clause license;
see the notices in each file for the full terms and copyright holders.

Bluetooth sources: Copyright MediaTek Inc., 2016-2017 and contributors.
Distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.
The complete license is included in MT7668-Bluetooth/COPYING.

Debian packaging: Copyright 2026 retro98boy <retro98boy@qq.com>.
Distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.
On Debian systems the full GPL version 2 is available at
/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2.

Firmware binaries and default configuration files in mt7668-firmware are
imported unchanged from MT7668-WiFi/7668_firmware in CoreELEC/MT7668.
No separate firmware license notice was supplied in that directory.
The driver source license notices above do not establish a firmware license.
